                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} i_{R \times S}:(R \times S) \hookrightarrow (T \times T)
              is defined by
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
